# No local Supabase worker (Hobby egress)

Daily `npm run dev` starts Docker Postgres (`localhost:5434`) and a **drain** worker that exits when queues are idle. Next stays up.

Do **not** set `CS_ALLOW_SUPABASE_WORKER=1` for that. Prod Vercel already uses Supabase (the hosted app); local worker must not.

`npm run worker:loop` is the old 15s forever process — not daily default.

Do **not** set `CS_ALLOW_SUPABASE_WORKER=1` for routine work. That flag is a **one-shot** override to touch prod Supabase (migrate, re-atomize). Unset it when the command finishes.

Worker code already refuses Supabase unless the flag is set. Do not weaken that guard.
